1
categories
categories

Ports are divided into categories.\
\
Ports live within /usr/ports/<category name>/<port name>\
\
Not all categories are physical categories (i.e. some categories do not have a /usr/ports/<category name> directory).  These are known as pseudo-categroies.\
\
Each port lives within a primary category.  AFAIK, a primary category must be a physical category (i.e. a directory /usr/ports/<category name> exists).

